      "title": "Usage: Dual CFG",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image-2.1 Image Edit — Dual CFG v1.0\n\nThis is an **Image Edit** workflow. Replace the source image in the left-side Load Image node; do not switch it to the empty latent path.\n\n### Default sampling settings\n- Total Steps: 25\n- Stage 1 CFG: 1.5\n- Stage 2 CFG: 3.0\n- Sigma Split: step 15 = 60 / 40\n- Stage 1 Sampler: Euler, add_noise on\n- Stage 2 Sampler: Euler, add_noise off\n- Seed: change only in Stage 1\n\nStage 1 output is passed directly into Stage 2. Stage 2 must not add fresh noise. SplitSigmas.step is an absolute step count, so adjust it manually if Total Steps changes."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Qwen-Image-2.1 Image Edit — Dual CFG v1.0\n\nThis is an **Image Edit** workflow. Replace the source image in the left-side Load Image node; do not switch it to the empty latent path.\n\n### Default sampling settings\n- Total Steps: 25\n- Stage 1 CFG: 1.5\n- Stage 2 CFG: 3.0\n- Sigma Split: step 15 = 60 / 40\n- Stage 1 Sampler: Euler, add_noise on\n- Stage 2 Sampler: Euler, add_noise off\n- Seed: change only in Stage 1\n\nStage 1 output is passed directly into Stage 2. Stage 2 must not add fresh noise. SplitSigmas.step is an absolute step count, so adjust it manually if Total Steps changes."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
