      "title": "プロンプト（Repair Prompt Presets）",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 手と足の破綻を修正するプロンプト\n\n~~~text\nEdit <image1> only to repair the malformed fingers, hands, toes, and feet. Reconstruct them with anatomically correct proportions, natural joint placement, five distinct fingers on each visible hand, and five distinct toes on each visible foot. Make the fingertips, fingernails, toe tips, and toenails clean and realistic, with no fused, duplicated, missing, twisted, or extra digits. Preserve the original person’s identity, face, hairstyle, body shape, pose, clothing, composition, camera angle, background, lighting, colors, and visual style exactly. Do not change any area except the hands, fingers, feet, and toes. Blend the repaired areas seamlessly into the original image.\n~~~\n\n## 手と指先だけの破綻を修正するプロンプト\n\n~~~text\nEdit <image1> only to repair the malformed fingers and hands. Reconstruct them with anatomically correct proportions, natural joint placement, and five distinct fingers on each visible hand. Make the fingertips and fingernails clean and realistic, with no fused, duplicated, missing, twisted, or extra fingers. Preserve the original person’s identity, face, hairstyle, body shape, pose, clothing, composition, camera angle, background, lighting, colors, and visual style exactly. Do not change any area except the hands and fingers. Blend the repaired areas seamlessly into the original image.\n~~~"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## 手と足の破綻を修正するプロンプト\n\n~~~text\nEdit <image1> only to repair the malformed fingers, hands, toes, and feet. Reconstruct them with anatomically correct proportions, natural joint placement, five distinct fingers on each visible hand, and five distinct toes on each visible foot. Make the fingertips, fingernails, toe tips, and toenails clean and realistic, with no fused, duplicated, missing, twisted, or extra digits. Preserve the original person’s identity, face, hairstyle, body shape, pose, clothing, composition, camera angle, background, lighting, colors, and visual style exactly. Do not change any area except the hands, fingers, feet, and toes. Blend the repaired areas seamlessly into the original image.\n~~~\n\n## 手と指先だけの破綻を修正するプロンプト\n\n~~~text\nEdit <image1> only to repair the malformed fingers and hands. Reconstruct them with anatomically correct proportions, natural joint placement, and five distinct fingers on each visible hand. Make the fingertips and fingernails clean and realistic, with no fused, duplicated, missing, twisted, or extra fingers. Preserve the original person’s identity, face, hairstyle, body shape, pose, clothing, composition, camera angle, background, lighting, colors, and visual style exactly. Do not change any area except the hands and fingers. Blend the repaired areas seamlessly into the original image.\n~~~"
      },
